i di protezione individuale possono trasformarsi rapidamente in situazioni pericolose. Imparate a riconoscere tempestivamente i pericoli e ad agire in modo sicuro.", "short_description": "Scoprite la sicurezza sul lavoro nell'edilizia in legno in modo virtuale e realistico: riconoscere i rischi tipici, reagire correttamente, senza alcun pericolo di lesioni. Imparate a evitare errori e a utilizzare in modo sicuro utensili e moduli."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Querformat.png", "id": "1735425970481901", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821696_1735425973815234_7026648888461368653_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kIILKJ7UNjoQ7kNvwEDyUXe&_nc_oc=AdoO4IVaKJD9-EH4eg6nKrUw-HFskHv3TJi0WpCXxGxCzW-GkCth8E0cUy2x9Kd6wX8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQO08VKg0trfCMq9rWRg5179pke-b0HBJaZXUeaC39wyeA&oe=6ADDFFA3"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1404469407857988", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819845_1404469411191321_2374008257608234867_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=V2W1drD9DZYQ7kNvwFJ88zi&_nc_oc=Adq4T-SDRZi0FBbEbLOCc_RmUn4QafXgNwVzQrxdOD6kBQdmpTgKNqTwttiS45_W3cc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNKsejvgrE6-OwsfYKixuQXwAgDDHJmEf9Bdc6e2c42Iw&oe=6ADE23DD"}, {"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Hochformat.png", "id": "1138371601691473", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_1138371605024806_6545105809583793091_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oEUBu1F31uwQ7kNvwFsGkVF&_nc_oc=AdrhMEKJqLoA9qRJ0Vn75t-SKzsl1pEtxLasJlHKQNJiGUJumZ-uR43n1HW8sgrhg0U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOEcBbDaa0jO0Twae_fUQJOvvi7EFX_uGLKuFLTd3EWVQ&oe=6ADE124A"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1061729109131103", "im